@startuml process_view_uc05_transfer_phase1_monolithique
title UC-05: Internal Transfer (Phase 2 Monolithe Optimisé)
autonumber

actor Client
participant "Nginx LB" as LB
participant "API Router" as Router
participant "Auth Middleware" as Middleware
participant "Transfers Handler" as Handler
participant "Transfers Service" as Transfers
database "Redis Cache" as Redis
database "MySQL" as DB

Client -> LB: POST /api/v1/transfers (Bearer Token, Idempotency-Key)
LB -> Router: Proxy Pass (Round-Robin)
Router -> Middleware: intercept
Middleware -> Middleware: Validate JWT & Extract UserID
Middleware --> Router: Context updated

Router -> Handler: Forward Request
activate Handler
Handler -> Transfers: ProcessTransfer(req)
activate Transfers

Transfers -> DB: SELECT * FROM transfers WHERE idempotency_key=?
DB --> Transfers: Not found (If found, return existing immediately)

Transfers -> DB: BEGIN Transaction
activate DB
Transfers -> DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id=? FOR UPDATE (Source)
Transfers -> DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id=? FOR UPDATE (Target)
DB --> Transfers: Accounts locked & retrieved

Transfers -> Transfers: Verify Source.Balance >= Amount
Transfers -> DB: UPDATE accounts SET balance=... (Source - Amount, Target + Amount)
Transfers -> DB: INSERT INTO transactions (LedgerTx)
Transfers -> DB: INSERT INTO ledger_entries (Source Debit, Target Credit)
Transfers -> DB: INSERT INTO transfers
Transfers -> DB: COMMIT Transaction
deactivate DB

Transfers -> Redis: DEL account:{source}:history, account:{target}:history
note right of Transfers: Invalidation du cache (Write-Through) pour garantir l'intégrité

Transfers --> Handler: Success (Transfer details)
deactivate Transfers

Handler --> Router: 201 Created
deactivate Handler

Router --> LB: Response
LB --> Client: 201 Created

@enduml
